he initial report and paper metadata.\n\n```python\nplan = [\n    {\"title\": \"Plan and baseline checks\", \"status\": \"doing\"},\n    {\"title\": \"Extract and read PDF pages 1–52 in batches\", \"status\": \"todo\"},\n    {\"title\": \"Record and consolidate five topic notes\", \"status\": \"todo\"},\n    {\"title\": \"Build report.json from the notes\", \"status\": \"todo\"},\n    {\"title\": \"Run pytest and verify final report\", \"status\": \"todo\"},\n]\nupdate_plan(plan)\nbase = run_command([\"python\", \"-m\", \"pytest\", \"-q\"], \".\")\nreport0 = read_file(\"report.json\")\npaper = read_file(\"paper.json\")\nprint(\"BASELINE_RC\", base[\"rc\"])\nprint(\"BASELINE_STDOUT\", base[\"stdout\"])\nprint(\"REPORT\", report0)\nprint(\"PAPER\", paper)\nprint(\"STATUS\", task_status())\n```", "refusal": null, "role": "assistant", "annotations": null, "audio": null, "function_call": null, "tool_calls": null}}], "created": 1793331583, "model": "deepseek-flash", "object": "chat.completion", "moderation": null, "service_tier": null, "system_fingerprint": "bc19ba97cbe016479903222bb1578db6", "usage": {"_type": "CompletionUsage", "completion_tokens": 382, "prompt_tokens": 4571, "total_tokens": 4953, "completion_tokens_details": {"_type": "CompletionTokensDetails", "accepted_prediction_tokens": null, "audio_tokens": null, "reasoning_tokens": 162, "rejected_prediction_tokens": null}, "prompt_tokens_details": {"_type": "PromptTokensDetails", "audio_tokens": null, "cache_write_tokens": null, "cached_tokens": 4352}}, "_request_id": null}, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 4571, "output_tokens": 382, "total_tokens": 4953}}, "model_output": "First I’ll set the paper-reading plan, run the baseline format check, and inspect the initial report and paper metadata.\n\n```python\nplan = [\n    {\"title\": \"Plan and baseline checks\", \"status\": \"doing\"},\n    {\"title\": \"Extract and read PDF pages 1–52 in batches\", \"status\": \"todo\"},\n    {\"title\": \"Record and consolidate 