{"event": "model_response", "time": 1793331589.779921, "run_id": "c570c0e7005948eeb07de36b31994d72", "seq": 31, "number": 2, "response": {"id": "db3bfeb1-402d-4443-820c-50f1e3061368", "object": "chat.completion", "created": 1793331588, "model": "deepseek-flash", "choices": [{"index": 0, "message": {"role": "assistant", "content": "Baseline fails only because `report.json` is still `{}`. I’ll now extract the required 52 pages in one logged call, then process the bounded batches in order.\n\n```python\nplan = [\n    {\"title\": \"Plan and baseline checks\", \"status\": \"done\"},\n    {\"title\": \"Extract and read PDF pages 1–52 in batches\", \"status\": \"doing\"},\n    {\"title\": \"Record and consolidate five topic notes\", \"status\": \"todo\"},\n    {\"title\": \"Build report.json from the notes\", \"status\": \"todo\"},\n    {\"title\": \"Run pytest and verify final report\", \"status\": \"todo\"},\n]\nupdate_plan(plan)\npdf = read_pdf(1, 52)\nprint(\"PAGES_RETURNED\", len(pdf.get(\"pages\", [])))\nprint(\"FIRST_LAST\", pdf[\"pages\"][0][\"page\"], pdf[\"pages\"][-1][\"page\"])\nprint(\"EVIDENCE_IDS\", pdf.get(\"evidence_ids\"))\n```", "reasoning_content": "Now extract pages 1-52 once using read_pdf tool. Then read delivered batches. Let me update plan and call read_pdf."}, "logprobs": null, "finish_reason": "stop"}], "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 5883, "completion_tokens": 244, "total_tokens": 6127, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 4224}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 29}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 4224, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 1659}, "system_fingerprint": "bc19ba97cbe016479903222bb1578db6"}, "classification": "ok"}
