ach to discover work that was cited but not yet included in our initial set.\"\n\nNote ≥20 chars, ≤1500. Write note now. Also need to continue reading remaining pages 6-52. Pending batch items are the rest of the extraction (9 batches). I need to print next pages, e.g. 6-8.\n\nLet me write the note and print pages 6-7 (from stored pdf).\n\nNote content must be within 1500 chars. Draft:\n\n\"overview (pages 1,4,5): Agentic LLMs defined by three capabilities: reason, act, interact. p4: \"Agents that receive input in natural language from their environment, reason to make decisions, and take autonomous actions in affecting their environment, to achieve specific goals.\" p5: \"The categories reasoning–acting–interacting build upon each other\" (virtuous circle, Fig.1). Literature selection p5: \"The papers were initially selected with a Google Scholar search on Agentic LLM. From there, we used a snowballing approach to discover work that was cited but not yet included in our initial set.\" → search_methods: google_scholar, snowballing. Only LLM-based approaches, related surveys (Li 2024, Wang 2024b, Gao 2024, Xi 2023) compared.\"\n\nThat's fine.\n\nThen print pages 6-7 text.\n\nBut the delivery: pages 6 already delivered above (ev-89534f70bedf0ab45dc5 page 6). Pages 7,8,9... not yet. Pending evidence ids list. I should print next unread pages: 7-8.\n\nActually the batch delivered pages 4,5,6. So next batch 7-8.\n\nNote: writing the note before/with print is fine. Use evidence_ids from delivered: page 4 ev-26c94297c50e4ef408a2, page5 ev-dbca06e364385e22f3c5, page 6 ev-89534f70bedf0ab45dc5.\n\nI'll write two notes? Only overview now. Keep budget."}, "logprobs": null, "finish_reason": "stop"}], "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 8646, "completion_tokens": 1349, "total_tokens": 9995, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 4224}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 832}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 4224, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 4422}, "system_fingerprint": "bc19