hs, evaluates them, and selects the most consistent answer using majority voting.\" (p.15-16): Self Refine and Reflexion use three LLM prompts: an actor-LLM, an evaluator-LLM, and a reflector-LLM; the actor generates text and actions, the evaluator scores the outputs, and the reflection model generates verbal reinforcement cues. ToT two search controllers: pending from p.12-13.', evidence_ids=['ev-b8db09947ef7c899cd9d', 'ev-ced75d6936911b2f0248', 'ev-9317b06df60c30a6c12c'], section='reasoning')", "observations": "Execution logs:\nLast output from code snippet:\n{'note_id': 'reasoning', 'sources': ['paper.pdf'], 'chars': 581}", "observations_images": null, "action_output": {"note_id": "reasoning", "sources": ["paper.pdf"], "chars": 581}, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 7899, "output_tokens": 607, "total_tokens": 8506}, "is_final_answer": false}}
