 search engine, a translation system, and a calendar.\" and API count quote \"ToolBench [Qin et al., 2023] contains 16,464 APIs from RapidAPI, a large dataset of publicly available REST APIs.\" Could combine both in one note. write_note requires evidence_ids from delivered headers: ev-731fa63b8d34dde45e62 (page 23). Use that.\n\nThen pending batch continues automatically after action. We should only output one Python block. Write note, then maybe print nothing. Let's do it."}, "logprobs": null, "finish_reason": "stop"}], "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 7831, "completion_tokens": 514, "total_tokens": 8345, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 4224}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 272}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 4224, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 3607}, "system_fingerprint": "bc19ba97cbe016479903222bb1578db6"}, "classification": "ok"}
