{"event": "tool_call", "time": 1793331661.3094232, "run_id": "c570c0e7005948eeb07de36b31994d72", "seq": 251, "tool": "write_note", "arguments": {"title": "multi_agent", "content": "multi_agent (p.32-37): 三层结构：非agentic LLM社会能力、角色分工的成对/小组agent、无预设角色自组织社会(p32)。4.2.2 CAMEL：两个LLM扮演预定义角色，p37原文：\"By using inception prompting and role descriptions, the agents stay in character and collaborate toward the goal by breaking down complex problems in manageable steps through dialogue.\" 故 camel_prompting = inception_prompting。p37还述creator-critic配对(Constitutional AI)、多agent辩论(Du et al.; MAD含judge)。p35：MAgIC用社交推理游戏与博弈场景评7项能力，GPT-o1与GPT-4显著更好；You.com助手在提议社会行为上优于人类。p35-36：GAMA-Bench、Alympics、AucArena等multi-agent博弈benchmark。Generative Agents的人类评估者人数待p38-39。", "evidence_ids": ["ev-98a30db9253fff6cc9da", "ev-a9b70da77a1c104405a2"], "section": "multi_agent"}}
