, evaluator and reflector LLM prompts. (p.18): self-reflection can be hard to debug because the same LLM generates and evaluates, and long traces overflow context. (p.19): limits include weak causal/counterfactual reasoning and poor common-sense abstraction. (p.20): reasoning work stays mostly benchmark decision-making rather than acting in the real world; tools and retrieval bridge to agency.\", evidence_ids=['ev-4049593a30e2846f8394'], section='reasoning')\nprint(r['content'][:200] if isinstance(r, dict) and 'content' in r else r)\nr2 = recall(['ev-a67fb4f311d1f21c4aba','ev-99f0f0a37d328bfed1a9','ev-01ce8948bcc88d235ea3'])\nprint(r2)", "observations": "Execution logs:\n{'note_id': 'reasoning', 'sources': ['paper.pdf'], 'chars': 1041}\n{'requested': [{'id': 'ev-a67fb4f311d1f21c4aba', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'locator': 'page:41'}, {'id': 'ev-99f0f0a37d328bfed1a9', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'locator': 'page:51'}, {'id': 'ev-01ce8948bcc88d235ea3', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'locator': 'page:52'}], 'queued': [{'id': 'ev-a67fb4f311d1f21c4aba', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'locator': 'page:41'}, {'id': 'ev-99f0f0a37d328bfed1a9', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'locator': 'page:51'}, {'id': 'ev-01ce8948bcc88d235ea3', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'locator': 'page:52'}], 'requested_count': 3, 'queued_count': 3, 'message': 'Queued, not delivered; the selector chooses the actual next batch.'}\nLast output from code snippet:\nNone", "observations_images": null, "action_output": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 8627, "output_tokens": 614, "total_tokens": 9241}, "is_final_answer": false}}
