lly.\n\nConclusion p52: \"all categories benefit from reasoning and self-verification.\" continuous quote: \"Robotic interaction and tool-use build on grounded retrieval augmentation, social interaction (such as theory of mind) builds on self reflection, and all categories benefit from reasoning and self-verification.\" This supports shared_foundations. Good.\n\nWrite note and recall p38/39."}, "logprobs": null, "finish_reason": "stop"}], "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 8846, "completion_tokens": 887, "total_tokens": 9733, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 4224}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 595}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 4224, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 4622}, "system_fingerprint": "bc19ba97cbe016479903222bb1578db6"}, "classification": "ok"}
